<title>UK: German inland gas oil gains, volume, demand thin.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil gains, volume, demand thin.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.5412)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     36.80/37.10     23.87/24.07     36.40/36.80</p>
<p> BREMEN		36.80/37.10     23.87/24.07     36.40/36.80</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    36.00/36.30     23.35/23.55     36.00/36.40</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   37.10/37.40     24.07/24.26     36.60/37.00</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   37.50/37.80     24.33/24.52     36.80/37.10</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  38.10/38.40     24.72/24.91     37.80/38.10</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices advanced on Friday in reaction to Thursday's futures gain. Demand remained slack, unimpressed by normally cold winter weather. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
